.DS_Store
*.log

# Java / Gradle / Fabric
.gradle/
build/
out/
*.class
run/

# IntelliJ
.idea/
*.iml

# C build artifacts (cubiomes is now a submodule and ignores its own build output)
#
# Listed by name rather than by pattern because the sources sit beside
# them: seedtypes.c is the source, seedtypes is the binary. Every new
# tool here needs a line, which is a nuisance - but `query` was once
# committed as a 500KB binary because this list was not updated when it
# was added.
seed-filter/smoketest
seed-filter/seedfilter
seed-filter/seedtypes
seed-filter/netherbiome
seed-filter/query
seed-filter/*.o
seed-filter/output/

# Node / CDK
node_modules/
cdk.out/

# Secrets - never commit these
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
brand/venv/
pack/*.mrpack
pack/*.jar

# Seed data stays out of the repository.
#
# The PIPELINE is public - how a seed is chosen, what it is checked
# against, why. The OUTPUT is not. Publishing the pool would let a
# player memorise the worlds they are about to be dealt, which defeats
# the rule that nobody draws the same seed twice, and it hands away the
# compute that produced it for nothing in return.
seed-filter/output/
seed-filter/output-backup/
seed-filter/results/
